    instagram: `Γ£¿ ${name}\n\n≡ƒÆ░ KES ${Number(price).toLocaleString()}\n≡ƒÅó ${showroom}\n≡ƒôì Nairobi, Kenya\n\nBook instantly on Car Care Connect ≡ƒÜù\nLink in bio ≡ƒæå\n\n${tags}`,
